Module: hcloud
Version: 0.2.0
Requires:
  Libraries: icinga-php-library (>=1.0.0), icinga-php-thirdparty (>=1.0.0)
Description: Browse Hetzner Cloud projects inside Icinga Web 2.
 Syncs servers, volumes, networks, load balancers, firewalls, IPs, certificates, DNS zones
 and storage boxes into a local database, and renders inventory, metrics and cost views from
 it. Read-only: the module never issues a mutating request against the Hetzner API.
